Version 4
SHEET 1 1200 720
WIRE 96 224 144 224
WIRE 224 224 288 224
FLAG 96 304 0
FLAG 288 288 0
FLAG 288 224 out
SYMBOL voltage 96 208 R0
SYMATTR InstName V1
SYMATTR Value AC 1
SYMBOL res 240 208 R90
SYMATTR InstName R1
SYMATTR Value 10k
SYMBOL cap 272 224 R0
SYMATTR InstName C1
SYMATTR Value {C}
TEXT 96 -40 Left 2 ;Chapter 18: RC low-pass. Plot V(out) to see the Bode plot: flat, then -20 dB per decade above fc.
TEXT 96 -8 Left 2 ;fc = 1/(2 pi R C): 15.9 Hz for 1 uF, 1.59 Hz for 10 uF.
TEXT 96 360 Left 2 !.ac dec 100 0.1 10k
TEXT 96 392 Left 2 !.step param C list 1u 10u
TEXT 96 424 Left 2 !.meas ac vmax MAX mag(V(out))
TEXT 96 456 Left 2 !.meas ac fc WHEN mag(V(out))=vmax*0.7071
